    "title": "Home by ShowingTime",
    "description": "Are you connected with a real estate agent who uses ShowingTime? Whether you\u2019re buying or selling a home, Home by ShowingTime simplifies the process by allowing you to easily manage showings, tours, feedback and more.\r\n\r\n\u00b7 View your upcoming tours as a buyer\r\n\u00b7 Manage your upcoming showings as a seller\r\n\u00b7 Easily connect with your agent\r\n\u00b7 Turn-by-turn directions to your next destination\r\n\u00b7 Review newly received showing feedback\r\n\u00b7 Set your communication preferences\r\n\u00b7 And more!\r\n\r\nShowingTime is a leading provider of residential real estate technology, used by agents and their clients to manage millions of home showings every month.",
